ggml: compact bias on the existing FLASH_ATTN_EXT for CUDA, ROCm and Vulkan

Upstream: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/32740 (open, not merged)
Head d29f9d489, merged onto llama.cpp 19bc41dbb. Generated with
`git diff 19bc41dbb <merge>`, unmodified.

Adds ggml_flash_attn_ext_add_indexed_bias(): Inkling 2's relative-position bias
reaches flash attention as a small table plus I32 indices instead of a dense
per-head mask. Needed by 0002. Drop this patch once the pin includes #32740;
if the API changes before merging, 0002 has to follow it.

